            "sid": "ISA 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wilderness and the dry land shall be glad; and the desert shall rejoice, and blossom as the rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It shall blossom abundantly, and rejoice even with joy and singing; the glory of Lebanon shall be given unto it, the excellency of Carmel and Sharon: they shall see the glory of Jehovah, the excellency of our God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Strengthen ye the weak hands, and confirm the feeble knees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say to them that are of a fearful heart, Be strong, fear not: behold, your God will come ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " vengeance, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the recompense of God; he will come and save you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the eyes of the blind shall be opened, and the ears of the deaf shall be unstopped. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall the lame man leap as a hart, and the tongue of the dumb shall sing; for in the wilderness shall waters break out, and streams in the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the glowing sand shall become a pool, and the thirsty ground springs of water: in the habitation of jackals, where they lay, shall be grass with reeds and rushes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And a highway shall be there, and a way, and it shall be called The way of holiness; the unclean shall not pass over it; but it shall be for ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": the wayfaring men, yea fools, shall not err ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No lion shall be there, nor shall any ravenous beast go up thereon; they shall not be found there; but the redeemed shall walk ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the ransomed of Jehovah shall return, and come with singing unto Zion; and everlasting joy shall be upon their heads: they shall obtain gladness and joy, and sorrow and sighing shall flee away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
